/-- The segment-`k` band hypothesis: every zero of `riemannZeta` in each of the
    `segCount k` strip boxes `[1/4000000, 3999999/4000000] x [segLo k i, segHi k i]`
    lies on the critical line.  An ASSUMPTION: each box claim is the conclusion (same
    strip, same box edges) of one `RHInBoxT_*` band theorem, whose Arb
    interval-arithmetic inputs (`hLine`, `hArbT`) nothing discharges in-kernel.
